# oracle: pair dpd/coul/slater/long 1.0 1.0 165412 0.25 2.0 with kspace pppm 1e-4, 3 types (two charged) in a 5^3 periodic box, 120 atoms, NVE 20 steps; random dpd forces on (T=1)
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): engine vs native max relative error between 1e-11 and 1e-10 (the cause of the last digits is not isolated; the random dpd forces match step by step); the case passes at rel=1e-10 abs=0 (the tightest tolerance that holds).
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=0
units        lj
boundary     p p p
atom_style   full
dimension    3
newton       on
comm_modify  vel yes
region       simBox block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box   3 simBox
create_atoms 1 random 60 4321 simBox
create_atoms 2 random 30 1111 simBox
create_atoms 3 random 30 2222 simBox
set          type 2 charge -1.0
set          type 3 charge 1.0
mass         * 1.0
velocity     all create 1.0 68768932
pair_style   dpd/coul/slater/long 1.0 1.0 165412 0.25 2.0
pair_coeff   1 1 78 4.5 no 1
pair_coeff   1 2 78 4.5 no 1
pair_coeff   1 3 78 4.5 no 1
pair_coeff   2 2 78 4.5 yes 1
pair_coeff   2 3 78 4.5 yes 1
pair_coeff   3 3 78 4.5 yes 1
kspace_style pppm 1e-4
timestep     0.01
fix          1 all nve
thermo_style custom step temp press vol evdwl ecoul elong pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo       5
run          20
